WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.835 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers
and this is "Late Night."

00:00:01.835 --> 00:00:04.204 align:start size:94% position:6%
How's everybody doing tonight?
Oh, that's so good to hear

00:00:04.204 --> 00:00:04.904 size:81% position:41% line:92%
Let's get to the news.

00:00:04.904 --> 00:00:07.707 align:start size:94% position:6%
The Biden administration
has reportedly run out of idea

00:00:07.707 --> 00:00:10.377 align:start size:94% position:6%
to encourage more people
to get the coronavirus vaccine

00:00:10.377 --> 00:00:15.815
Luckily, the virus is coming u
with new ideas all the time.

00:00:15.815 --> 00:00:17.317 align:start size:94% position:6%
Vice President
Kamala Harris yesterday

00:00:17.317 --> 00:00:20.920 align:start size:94% position:6%
praised Texas House Democrats'
plan to leave the state

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:22.155 line:92%
ahead of a Republican-led effort

00:00:22.155 --> 00:00:24.324 align:start size:94% position:6%
to pass a restrictive
new voting law.

00:00:24.324 --> 00:00:27.560
"Hey, I was leaving Texas
way before it was cool,"

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.229 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
said Ted Cruz.

00:00:29.229 --> 00:00:31.398 align:start size:94% position:6%
Fox News is reportedly
planning to launch

00:00:31.398 --> 00:00:33.533 align:start size:94% position:6%
a 24-hour weather channel
later this year.

00:00:33.533 --> 00:00:35.402 align:start size:94% position:6%
Finally, branching out
into something

00:00:35.402 --> 00:00:39.539 align:start size:94% position:6%
where it's acceptable
to be wrong half the time.

00:00:39.539 --> 00:00:42.575
It was announced on Sunday
that Tesla CEO Elon Musk

00:00:42.575 --> 00:00:45.145 align:start size:94% position:6%
had purchased a ticket
on a space flight

00:00:45.145 --> 00:00:47.180 align:start size:94% position:6%
from Richard Branson's
Virgin Galactic.

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:48.381 line:92%
Well, Elon, don't be nervous

00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:50.984
If you drive a Tesla,
you're statistically more likely

00:00:50.984 --> 00:00:55.155 align:start size:94% position:6%
to have an accident
on the way to the airport.

00:00:55.155 --> 00:00:58.358 align:start size:94% position:6%
Today was actor Harrison Ford'
79th birthday.

00:00:58.358 --> 00:00:59.793 align:start size:94% position:6%
In the next
"Indiana Jones" movie,

00:00:59.793 --> 00:01:01.694 align:start size:94% position:6%
he searches
an ancient Egyptian temple

00:01:01.694 --> 00:01:05.832
for the glasses that were on top
of his head the whole time

00:01:05.832 --> 00:01:08.001 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.001 --> 00:01:10.537 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Growling ]

00:01:10.537 --> 00:01:12.305 line:92%
[ Growling ] "Here they are.

00:01:12.305 --> 00:01:14.507 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.507 --> 00:01:16.976 align:start size:94% position:6%
Mattel yesterday released a ne
Barbie doll

00:01:16.976 --> 00:01:18.578 line:92%
of tennis star Naomi Osaka

00:01:18.578 --> 00:01:24.284 align:start size:94% position:6%
and the Barbie doll of a
reporter is already mad at her

00:01:24.284 --> 00:01:26.152 align:start size:94% position:6%
New photos were
recently released

00:01:26.152 --> 00:01:27.387 align:start size:94% position:6%
from the
"Sex and the City" reboot,

00:01:27.387 --> 00:01:30.256 align:start size:94% position:6%
which follows the characters
lives into their 50s.

00:01:30.256 --> 00:01:31.491 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so far,
it looks pretty accurate,

00:01:31.491 --> 00:01:35.495 align:start size:94% position:6%
because they have fewer friend
now that they're older.

00:01:35.495 --> 00:01:37.764 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's right,
the "Sex and the City" reboo

00:01:37.764 --> 00:01:40.366 align:start size:94% position:6%
follows the characters' live
into their 50s.

00:01:40.366 --> 00:01:41.167 line:92%
It's pretty much the same,

00:01:41.167 --> 00:01:44.404 align:start size:94% position:6%
except Carrie accidentally
types her whole column

00:01:44.404 --> 00:01:46.172 size:81% position:41% line:92%
into the subject line.

00:01:46.172 --> 00:01:48.475 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:48.475 --> 00:01:50.777 size:81% position:41%
And finally, officials
from a Minnesota city

00:01:50.777 --> 00:01:54.280 align:start size:94% position:6%
have asked residents
not to release pet goldfis

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:54.948 size:75% position:38% line:92%
into ponds and lakes

00:01:54.948 --> 00:01:57.650 align:start size:94% position:6%
after they discovered
a fish the size of a football.

00:01:57.650 --> 00:02:01.821 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, you wont believe the size
of the castle they found.

00:02:01.821 --> 00:02:04.023 align:start size:94% position:6%
And that was the monologue
you guys,

00:02:04.023 --> 00:02:08.328 align:start size:94% position:6%
and quite a fine one,
if I may say so.

